  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Knowledge of at least one technique</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you are in a state where you could enter Aristeia or are in Aristeia, you roll twice when determining the failure chance of techniques you perform, taking the result of your choice.</p>\n<p>While in Aristeia, the complexity cost of any techniques you perform is reduced by your level of Aristeia (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/aristeia-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
